cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it, and cite the upstream work it builds on."
title: "Navier-Stokes, Fefferman's A or B or C or D: community verification package (R2 final, with R3 alternative packages)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "kts-global"
version: "V1"
abstract: "Lean 4.34.1 verification package for the encoded forms of Fefferman's alternatives (C) and (D) of the Navier-Stokes problem and the disjunction through them. Alternatives (A) and (B) are open and are shipped as statement files only. Not independently reviewed."
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Navier-Stokes
  - formal verification
references:
